\title{baux}
\author{Kvutza}
\date{2026-11-11}
\meta{external}{https://github.com/Kvutza/baux}

\p{
  \strong{baux} is a black box optimization library built around Epistemic Nearest Neighbors (Bafna et al. [[BJS25]](https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.12818)) and trust-region search.
}

